  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Global Fund Accelerator technical assistance facility (GFA Facility)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity UK Global Fund Accelerator technical assistance facility (GFA Facility) is a component of UK investment in the Global Fund 2020-2022 to reduce transmission and mortality for HIV AIDS, tuberculosis and malaria through treatments, diagnostics and preventive technologies and related services reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xA3;15,816,203. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
